wiki/docs/building.mdx:12:If a connected part is in an unloaded chunk, the multiblock pauses until the chunk loads, and the core screen says so.
wiki/docs/building.mdx:16:The core can't tell what is in an unloaded chunk, so a multiblock built against the edge of the loaded area also pauses until the next chunk loads, even when no part is in it.
